    },
    "bgm": "015",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200501/2022005010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ごめん、大丈夫か？\r\nどこか怪我とか──……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005010080,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "だ……大丈夫です……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200501/2022005010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それならよかった……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺もだけど、\r\n小糸も曲がり角には気をつけような",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005010090,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "は、はい……\r\nす、すみません……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200501/2022005010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その様子だと\r\n自主トレ中……体力づくりか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005010100,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "あ……えっと……\r\nだ、ダンスとかもそうなんですけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200501/2022005010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005010110,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "が、学校でも\r\n持久走の大会、あるので",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200501/2022005010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか\r\nそういう季節だもんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、学生時代を思い出すよ\r\n持久走って寒い中だし、大変だよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005010120,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200501/2022005010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こうやってしっかり対策してて\r\n小糸はすごいな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005010130,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "え…………",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200501/2022005010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "普段のレッスンもかなりの運動量だし\r\n持久力もついてきたんじゃないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005010140,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "あ、えっと……\r\n今日は河川敷の方をぐるっと回って……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200501/2022005010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005010150,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "事務所まであとちょっと\r\n途中で止まらないでいけそうな感じだったんですけど……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200501/2022005010150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うわ……、すまん\r\n俺がぶつかって止めちゃったんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005010160,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "あ、い、いえ……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200501/2022005010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、結構な距離じゃないか\r\nその距離を止まらずに走れるなんて大したものだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
